# This repository is rooted at $HOME, but it only tracks the NixOS
# configuration. Everything is ignored by default and the config trees are
# re-included explicitly, so a stray file in $HOME can never be committed by
# accident -- which is how ~1 GB of Minecraft saves, Steam blobs, shell
# histories and private keys ended up staged here once before.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/nix/
!/archive/

# Rebuild and editor leftovers inside the tracked trees.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.swp
*~
/nix/result
/nix/result-*
